OL,3,GNEWSASix farms targeted in single night
OL,4,Aof burglaries
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix sites have been hit in a single
OL,7,Fnight of burglaries at farms and farm
OL,8,Fshops in East Sussex, police say.
OL,10,FThe incidents happened in Little
OL,11,FHorsted, Hadlow Down, Mark Cross,
OL,12,FRingmer, Glynde and Mayfield across
OL,13,FFriday night and Saturday morning,
OL,14,FSussex Police said.
OL,16,FThe owners of South Brockwells Farm
OL,17,FShop near Uckfield previously said they
OL,18,Flost all their Christmas stock and
OL,19,Fbutchering equipment, while other sites
OL,20,Falso reported alcohol being taken.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
