OL,3,GNEWSASix farms targeted in single night
OL,4,Aof burglaries
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Rob Tillyer said: "It is
OL,7,Funusual to have multiple locations to
OL,8,Fbe targeted in one evening but it is
OL,9,Flikely that these were opportunists and
OL,10,Fwe consider the incidents linked."
